# Only the workspace's package sources and its lock file are needed.
#
# The context is the plugin's root, which on a user's machine may be a clone
# with local files beside the committed ones: everything is excluded unless it
# is named here, and inside what is named, whatever a clone may hold that is
# not part of the sources (secrets, environments, caches, notes, tests) is
# excluded again.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages
**/tests
**/testbed*
**/CONTEXT
**/.git
**/.claude
**/.venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
